geometry.cjs adapts the RGB normalization, crop bounds, 66-point heatmap/offset
decoding and landmark conventions from OpenSeeFace tracker.py into JavaScript.
regions.cjs uses its mouth topology with shared corners 58 and 62. The upstream
code is BSD-2-Clause under the same copyright and LICENSE. Quality checks,
selected-face validation and this application's fallback integration are added.
The model weights are unchanged. No upstream binary bundle or training dataset
is included. This module uses the application's existing ONNX Runtime and Sharp.
